      }
    ],
    "Description": "### Summary\n\n`Application.add_domain()` compiled each `*` in a host mask to `[^:]*`. With two or more wildcards in a mask, matching a long `Host` header that does not match the mask took polynomial time on the event loop.\n\n### Impact\n\nAn attacker could stall a server that registers a domain mask with more than one wildcard by sending requests with a long `Host` header.\n\n### Workaround\n\nUse at most one `*` in a domain mask.\n\n---\n\nPatch: https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/commit/c6ac0e44c3c573ff9616f4a6a532992538b31e43",
